        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>模型63 多个函数的综合问题（1）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #f0e4d0;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 30px 40px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .section-label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 14px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  table, th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n  }\n  td {\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .label-col {\n    width: 12%;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  .center-cell {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .formula-cell {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .graph-cell {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .example-block {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .example-text {\n    text-indent: 0;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n  }\n  .fig-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 12px 0;\n  }\n  .options-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n  }\n  .page-number {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"title\">模型 63&nbsp;&nbsp;多个函数的综合问题（1）</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-label\">【模型分析】</div>\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"label-col\">反比例函数</td>\n    <td class=\"formula-cell\" colspan=\"2\">$y=\\dfrac{k}{x}$&nbsp;&nbsp;（$k\\neq0$）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"label-col\">$k$ 的符号</td>\n    <td class=\"center-cell\">$k>0$</td>\n    <td class=\"center-cell\">$k<0$</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"label-col\">图像</td>\n    <td class=\"graph-cell\">\n      <svg width=\"150\" height=\"130\" viewBox=\"0 0 150 130\">\n        <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <polygon points=\"140,65 132,61 132,69\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"/>\n        <text x=\"142\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"12\">x</text>\n        <line x1=\"75\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"75\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <polygon points=\"75,10 71,18 79,18\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"/>\n        <text x=\"80\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"12\">y</text>\n        <text x=\"63\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\">O</text>\n        <path d=\"M 95,15 C 82,25 78,45 78,63\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <path d=\"M 72,67 C 72,85 68,105 55,115\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </td>\n    <td class=\"graph-cell\">\n      <svg width=\"150\" height=\"130\" viewBox=\"0 0 150 130\">\n        <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <polygon points=\"140,65 132,61 132,69\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"/>\n        <text x=\"142\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"12\">x</text>\n        <line x1=\"75\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"75\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <polygon points=\"75,10 71,18 79,18\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"/>\n        <text x=\"80\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"12\">y</text>\n        <text x=\"63\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"12\">O</text>\n        <path d=\"M 55,15 C 68,25 72,45 72,63\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <path d=\"M 78,67 C 78,85 82,105 95,115\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"label-col\">性质</td>\n    <td>\n      ①$x$ 的取值范围是 $x\\neq0$，$y$ 的取值范围是 $y\\neq0$<br>\n      ②当 $k>0$ 时，函数图像两个分支分别在一、三象限，在每个象限内，$y$ 随着 $x$ 增大而减小\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      ①$x$ 的取值范围是 $x\\neq0$，$y$ 的取值范围是 $y\\neq0$<br>\n      ②当 $k<0$ 时，函数图像两个分支分别在二、四象限，在每个象限内，$y$ 随着 $x$ 增大而增大\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"section-label\">【经典例题】</div>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n  <div class=\"example-text\">\n    例1.（2020·浙江九年级一模）有下列四个函数：①$y=2x$；②$y=-\\dfrac{2}{3}x+4$；③$y=\\dfrac{4}{x}$；\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"example-text\">\n    ④$y=-\\left(x-\\dfrac{8}{3}\\right)^2+\\dfrac{31}{9}$．其中图象经过如图所示阴影部分（包括边界）的函数有（&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"fig-wrap\">\n    <svg width=\"230\" height=\"220\" viewBox=\"0 0 230 220\">\n      <!-- axes -->\n      <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n      <polygon points=\"210,180 202,176 202,184\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"/>\n      <text x=\"212\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"12\">x</text>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"15\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n      <polygon points=\"45,15 41,23 49,23\" fill=\"#2b2b2b\"/>\n      <text x=\"50\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"12\">y</text>\n      <text x=\"30\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"12\">O</text>\n\n      <!-- grid lines vertical (x=1..4) -->\n      <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"115\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"185\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/>\n\n      <!-- grid lines horizontal (y=1..4) -->\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"/>\n\n      <!-- x labels -->\n      <text x=\"77\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"11\">1</text>\n      <text x=\"112\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"11\">2</text>\n      <text x=\"147\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"11\">3</text>\n      <text x=\"182\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"11\">4</text>\n\n      <!-- y labels -->\n      <text x=\"33\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"11\">1</text>\n      <text x=\"33\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"11\">2</text>\n      <text x=\"33\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"11\">3</text>\n      <text x=\"33\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"11\">4</text>\n\n      <!-- shaded triangle: vertices (2,3) top-left, (2,1) bottom-left, (3,1) bottom-right -->\n      <polygon points=\"115,75 115,145 150,145\" fill=\"#888\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#2b2b2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"options-row\">\n    <span>A. ①②</span>\n    <span>B. ①③</span>\n    <span>C. ②③</span>\n    <span>D. ②③④</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"page-number\">36</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
